# Configuration for `npm run preview:deployed`, which serves the production build from one origin
# that also proxies the API — the topology of a real deployment.
#
# It is a mode file rather than an inline variable in the script, because `VAR=value command` is not
# valid in cmd or PowerShell: the script would have failed for anyone evaluating this on Windows.
# `vite build --mode preview` reads this, and `vite preview` takes the proxy from vite.config.ts.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/
